2. Resumen del curso 
The English course B2.1 Vantage 1 is designed to help students refine and expand their advanced intermediate English skills, 
with a focus on consolidating higher-level language competencies to handle an even more complex variety of communicative 
situations. Through advanced activities and more extensive linguistic challenges, students will develop the ability to tackle 
sophisticated communicative contexts, participate effectively in detailed debates on specialized topics, and comprehend 
complex texts with g reater depth. This course emphasizes improving fluency and accuracy in communication, enabling 
students to express ideas with greater clarity and nuance, and interact confidently and competently in a wide range of 
situations and topics in English. 
3. Competencias de formación 
Id Competencia Id Resultado de aprendizaje esperado 
1 
Understands the main ideas of 
complex texts on concrete and abstract 
topics, including technical discussions 
in their field of specialization, and 
interacts fluently and spontaneously, 
enabling regular conversation with 
native speakers. 
1.1 Understands speeches or presentations that are clearly articulated on general and specific topics within their area of interest. 
1.2 Understands articles and reports that address contemporary or technical topics with some depth. 
1.3 Communicates with sufficient fluency and spontaneity to interact with native speakers without causing them discomfort. 
1.4 Writes simple essays or reports that develop arguments for or against a point of view. 
4. Contenidos 
