2. Resumen del curso 
The B1.1 Threshold 1 English course is designed to help students consolidate and expand their intermediate English  
skills, developing their ability to handle a wider range of communicative situations. Through interactive activities and  
linguistic challenges, students will learn to navigate more complex scenarios, engage in discussions on various topics,  
and analyze more detailed texts. This course focuses on refining fluency and accuracy in communication, strengthening  
students'' ability to interact with greater confidence and effectiveness in diverse contexts and in exchanging more  
sophisticated ideas in English. 
3. Competencias de formación 
Id Competencia Id Resultado de aprendizaje esperado 
1 
Identifies the main points of clear texts 
in standard language on familiar topics 
in work, school, or leisure situations, 
facing most situations that arise when 
traveling in a region where the language 
is spoken. 
1.1 Identifies the main points of a clear, standard conversation on familiar topics like work, school, or leisure. 
1.2 Understands simple texts related to everyday or personal interest topics, such as letters, emails, or brief news reports. 
1.3 Participates in simple conversations on everyday and familiar topics, exchanging information and expressing opinions simply. 
1.4 Writes brief and clear texts, such as emails or descriptions, on familiar topics or personal interest. 
