2. Resumen del curso 
The A2.2 Waystage 2 English course is designed to help students consolidate and expand their basic English skills, as well as  
boost their confidence in communicating in a variety of everyday situations. Through dynamic and practical activities, 
students will learn to tackle more complex situations, discuss topics of personal interest, and understand more elaborate 
texts. This course focuses on improving fluency and accuracy in communication, strengthening students'' ability to interact 
with greater confidence and effectiveness in English. 
3. Competencias de formación 
Id Competencia Id Resultado de aprendizaje esperado 
1 
Understands frequently used phrases 
and expressions in everyday contexts, 
such as conversations about family 
topics, shopping, or work, 
demonstrating skills to participate in 
simple and direct communicative 
exchanges, as well as in the production 
of short texts on familiar or personal 
aspects. 
1.1 Understands short conversations on habitual topics, such as daily activities or personal interests, when spoken clearly and slowly. 
1.2 Understands short texts, such as emails or informal letters, on topics of immediate relevance, like making arrangements to meet or making plans. 
1.3 
Interacts in simple communicative situations, such as shopping or making 
reservations, using familiar phrases and appropriate responses to 
exchange basic information. 
1.4 
Writes brief and connected texts, such as simple emails or personal 
letters, describing experiences or everyday situations and expressing 
basic opinions on familiar topics. 
4. Contenidos 
